# Estimate AI Project Rule (updated 2026-10-28)

Before starting, read root AGENTS.md, docs/AI_HANDOFF.md, docs/AGENTS.md,
docs/DOMAIN_RULES.md and the relevant workflow document.

This is NOT the old Phase 0 local-only VBA port. The supplied source ZIP
contains a deterministic Python matching core, SQLite catalog, FastAPI web
service, RNMC/TKP imports and admin UI. Do not scaffold these anew.

Source of truth: latest user-uploaded project ZIP. Canonical GitHub repository
AIestimGRO/estimate-ai, working branch feature/admin-ui, may be verified when
needed but is not automatically the user's current code snapshot.

Never invent prices or silently alter VBA-derived business rules. Before and
after code/documentation edits run python -m pytest -q. Preserve unrelated
files and return a ZIP, not a patch. Never include production DBs, backups,
private keys, logs or client source workbooks in source delivery.

The Windows production deployment differs from local development: see
docs/SERVER_RUNBOOK.md and docs/DATA_IMPORT_GUARDRAILS.md. Use backups and
staged verification; never overwrite SQLite while web service is running.
